<h1>About DjeLab</h1>
<p>
    DjeLab (Djehuti Lab AI+) is an AI-driven numerical computation environment: bring your own AI
    provider key, describe a mathematical problem in natural language, and get F# code that's
    reviewed, sandboxed, executed, and graphed.
</p>
